{
  "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
  "sourceName": "Saheeh International",
  "language": "en",
  "direction": "ltr",
  "surahNumber": 80,
  "entries": [
    {
      "verseKey": "80:1",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 1,
      "text": "He [i.e., the Prophet (ﷺ) ] frowned and turned away",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:2",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 2,
      "text": "Because there came to him the blind man, [interrupting].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:3",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 3,
      "text": "But what would make you perceive, [O Muḥammad], that perhaps he might be purified",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:4",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 4,
      "text": "Or be reminded and the remembrance would benefit him?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:5",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 5,
      "text": "As for he who thinks himself without need,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:6",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 6,
      "text": "To him you give attention.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:7",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 7,
      "text": "And not upon you [is any blame] if he will not be purified.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:8",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 8,
      "text": "But as for he who came to you striving [for knowledge]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:9",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 9,
      "text": "While he fears [Allāh],",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:10",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 10,
      "text": "From him you are distracted.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:11",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 11,
      "text": "No! Indeed, they [i.e., these verses] are a reminder;",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:12",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 12,
      "text": "So whoever wills may remember it.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:13",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 13,
      "text": "[It is recorded] in honored sheets,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:14",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 14,
      "text": "Exalted and purified,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:15",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 15,
      "text": "[Carried] by the hands of messenger-angels,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:16",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 16,
      "text": "Noble and dutiful.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:17",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 17,
      "text": "Destroyed [i.e., cursed] is man; how disbelieving is he.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:18",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 18,
      "text": "From what thing [i.e., substance] did He create him?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:19",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 19,
      "text": "From a sperm-drop He created him and destined for him;",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:20",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 20,
      "text": "Then He eased the way for him;",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:21",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 21,
      "text": "Then He causes his death and provides a grave for him.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:22",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 22,
      "text": "Then when He wills, He will resurrect him.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:23",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 23,
      "text": "No! He [i.e., man] has not yet accomplished what He commanded him.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:24",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 24,
      "text": "Then let mankind look at his food -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:25",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 25,
      "text": "How We poured down water in torrents,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:26",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 26,
      "text": "Then We broke open the earth, splitting [it with sprouts],",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:27",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 27,
      "text": "And caused to grow within it grain",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:28",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 28,
      "text": "And grapes and herbage",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:29",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 29,
      "text": "And olive and palm trees",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:30",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 30,
      "text": "And gardens of dense shrubbery",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:31",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 31,
      "text": "And fruit and grass -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:32",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 32,
      "text": "[As] enjoyment [i.e., provision] for you and your grazing livestock.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:33",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 33,
      "text": "But when there comes the Deafening Blast",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:34",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 34,
      "text": "On the Day a man will flee from his brother",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:35",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 35,
      "text": "And his mother and his father",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:36",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 36,
      "text": "And his wife and his children,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:37",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 37,
      "text": "For every man, that Day, will be a matter adequate for him.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:38",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 38,
      "text": "[Some] faces, that Day, will be bright -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:39",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 39,
      "text": "Laughing, rejoicing at good news.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:40",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 40,
      "text": "And [other] faces, that Day, will have upon them dust.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:41",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 41,
      "text": "Blackness will cover them.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "80:42",
      "surahNumber": 80,
      "ayahNumber": 42,
      "text": "Those are the disbelievers, the wicked ones.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    }
  ]
}
